# ABP Correlation ID

## Accessing Correlation ID
```csharp
public class MyService : ITransientDependency
{
    private readonly ICorrelationIdProvider _correlationIdProvider;

    public void LogSomething()
    {
        var correlationId = _correlationIdProvider.Get();
        _logger.LogInformation("Processing with CorrelationId: {CorrelationId}", correlationId);
    }
}
```

## Use Cases
- Track requests across microservices
- Correlate logs in distributed systems
- Debug cross-service operations

Correlation ID is automatically generated per HTTP request and propagated to downstream services.
